# Variáveis de ambiente — Finances (monorepo)
#
# Cada app tem o SEU arquivo:
#
#   backend/.env   → API Nest + Postgres
#   frontend/.env  → Web (Vite) — só VITE_*
#
# Setup local:
#   cp backend/.env.example backend/.env
#   cp frontend/.env.example frontend/.env
#   docker compose up -d   # Postgres :5446
#   npm install
#   npm run backend:dev    # http://localhost:3002/api/health
#   npm run frontend:dev   # http://localhost:8081
#
# Docs: docs/ARCHITECTURE.md
